{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Act as an expert Shopify theme developer. Generate a responsive, pixel-perfect, custom split-layout feature section titled "Why Retailers Choose Flow". The layout must 100% replicate the spacing, visual hierarchy, alignment, and subtle divider rules of the provided reference design while automatically inheriting the active Shopify theme's global typography, primary max-width (e.g., 1200px), and core link styles.
    
    ---
    
    ### 1. CUSTOMIZABLE SCHEMA REQUIREMENTS (BACKEND SETTINGS)
    
    Ensure every content element is entirely dynamic and editable in the Shopify theme customization editor. Provide the following settings fields:
    - Section-Level Settings:
      - Text: Main Left Heading
      - Textarea: Main Left Sub-description
      - Text: Call to Action Link Text
      - URL: Call to Action Link URL
    - Repeatable Block Settings (Block type: "feature_item", max: 6 blocks total):
      - Image/SVG Picker: Custom Icon Upload
      - Text: Feature Block Title
      - Textarea: Feature Block Description Paragraph
    
    ---
    
    ### 2. SECTION ARCHITECTURE & SPLIT-LAYOUT
    
    #### OVERALL CONTAINER
    - Restrain the parent section wrapper to the theme's core page width (e.g., `var(--page-width)` or `1200px`) and center it on large viewports.
    - Apply a two-column desktop layout (using flexbox or a 1fr 1fr grid) with a wide, editorial column gap (around 64px to 80px).
    - Mobile Layout: Stack columns vertically, placing the left content panel cleanly above the right feature list.
    
    #### LEFT COLUMN: INTRODUCTORY PANEL (Fixed/Sticky Optional)
    - Width: Occupies approximately 40% to 45% of the desktop horizontal space.
    - Element 1 (Main Heading): Bold, large, editorial typography in a dark navy/slate tone (e.g., "Why Retailers Choose Flow"). High line-height comfort.
    - Element 2 (Description): A paragraph of medium-grey, elegant text with substantial spacing above it to separate it cleanly from the title.
    - Element 3 (Call to Action Link): A bold, text-based link styled in the dark navy tone reading "Talk to our team" accompanied by an inline right-facing arrow chevron (›). Ensure explicit margin below it.
    
    #### RIGHT COLUMN: REPEATABLE FEATURE ROW LIST
    - Width: Occupies approximately 55% to 60% of the desktop horizontal space.
    - Content Pattern: A vertical stack of dynamic blocks. Each individual feature block is separated from the next by a thin, full-width neutral-light horizontal divider line (`1px solid #f1f5f9` or theme equivalent). The very first item should feature a clean top padding relative to the layout grid line.
    - Inner Block Layout (Flex Row):
      - Left Side (Icon Badge): A square container with rounded corners (border-radius: 8px) using a very soft, washed-out olive/moss green tinted background. Inside, center a thin-lined icon (e.g., target, checkmark circle, shield) matching a muted moss green color (`#a4b953` or theme equivalent).
      - Right Side (Feature Text Content): Positioned immediately next to the badge with an intentional spacing gap:
        - Feature Heading: Bold, dark slate blue/navy text, medium size, crisp rendering.
        - Feature Description: Placed directly under the heading. Medium-grey text color, highly legible body sizing, fluid line-height (1.5-1.6).
    
    ---
    
    ### 3. DESIGN & BRAND ALIGNMENT RULES
    
    - Typography: Do NOT hardcode specific font families or style sizes in pixels where it conflicts with global rules. Force all headings to inherit the primary theme heading font family, and descriptions to use the baseline body font.
    - Apothecary Minimalist Aesthetics: Maintain generous, intentional whitespace between the vertical feature blocks. Ensure the green accents are quiet and natural (`#a4b953`), and background zones default to transparent or a flat, pure white tone to ensure a clean look.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-split-feature-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 80px 0;
  }

  .ai-split-feature-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 64px;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 990px) {
    .ai-split-feature-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 42fr 58fr;
      gap: 80px;
    }
  }

  .ai-split-feature-left-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .ai-split-feature-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-split-feature-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin: 0;
  }


  .ai-split-feature-cta-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-family: var(--text-font-family);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  .ai-split-feature-cta-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .ai-split-feature-cta-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .ai-split-feature-right-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .ai-split-feature-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: 20px;
    padding: 32px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
  }

  .ai-split-feature-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}:first-child {
    padding-top: 0;
    border-top: none;
  }

  .ai-split-feature-icon-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 56px;
    height: 56px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background-color: #f0f4e8;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .ai-split-feature-icon-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} img {
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    object-fit: contain;
  }

  .ai-split-feature-icon-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    color: #a4b953;
  }

  .ai-split-feature-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .ai-split-feature-item-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-split-feature-item-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-split-feature-placeholder-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }
{% endstyle %}

<split-feature-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-split-feature-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-split-feature-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-split-feature-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-split-feature-left-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.main_heading != blank %}
          <h2 class="ai-split-feature-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} h1">{{ block.settings.main_heading }}</h2>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.main_description != blank %}
          <p class="ai-split-feature-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.main_description }}</p>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.cta_text != blank %}
          <a href="{{ block.settings.cta_url | default: '#' }}" class="ai-split-feature-cta-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.cta_text }}
            <span class="ai-split-feature-cta-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }}">›</span>
          </a>
        {% endif %}
      </div>

      <div class="ai-split-feature-right-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% for i in (1..6) %}
          {% liquid
            assign icon_key = 'feature_' | append: i | append: '_icon'
            assign title_key = 'feature_' | append: i | append: '_title'
            assign description_key = 'feature_' | append: i | append: '_description'
            
            assign feature_icon = block.settings[icon_key]
            assign feature_title = block.settings[title_key]
            assign feature_description = block.settings[description_key]
          %}

          {% if feature_title != blank or feature_description != blank %}
            <div class="ai-split-feature-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <div class="ai-split-feature-icon-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {% if feature_icon != blank %}
                  <img 
                    src="{{ feature_icon | image_url: width: 56 }}" 
                    alt="{{ feature_title | escape }}"
                    width="28"
                    height="28"
                    loading="lazy"
                  >
                {% else %}
                  <div class="ai-split-feature-placeholder-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                      <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
                      <path d="M12 16v-4"></path>
                      <path d="M12 8h.01"></path>
                    </svg>
                  </div>
                {% endif %}
              </div>

              <div class="ai-split-feature-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {% if feature_title != blank %}
                  <h3 class="ai-split-feature-item-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ feature_title }}</h3>
                {% endif %}

                {% if feature_description != blank %}
                  <p class="ai-split-feature-item-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ feature_description }}</p>
                {% endif %}
              </div>
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</split-feature-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class SplitFeatureSection{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
      }

      connectedCallback() {
        this.style.display = 'block';
      }
    }

    customElements.define('split-feature-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}', SplitFeatureSection{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

